 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how's everything with you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The bathroom faucet keeps dripping and I'm not sure how to deal with it.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "block": "home_repair.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Listen to all of them first, then comment.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure.",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.7,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The first option is to replace the little washer inside myself, which is cheap but I've never done it.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "block": "home_repair.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Then there's buying a whole new faucet, which looks nicer but I'd still have to install it.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 2.7,
   "block": "home_repair.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the last one is calling a plumber, who said he can come next week but charges a lot.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 2.57,
   "block": "home_repair.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, that's all of them. What do you think?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.1,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "How old is the faucet? If it's fairly new, try the washer first, it's cheap and you'll learn something. If it's ancient, a new faucet might be worth it, and you can call the plumber if you get stuck.",
   "est_sec": 12.19,
